{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_02_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_02",
  "title": "察言观色",
  "storyCode": "GT-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f1e956dcf1e8af64b12a3903c95c4ce93f603b2f1ed1f6f705c00de6ed6350eb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拦住她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拦什么啊！你没看到他们全部被干掉了吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你上啊，你平常不是很厉害吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我不行！这家伙可是那个灾星啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）拦住我的都会死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）向我挥出武器的都粉身碎骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）想死的，向前踏出一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“上尉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你究竟在说些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉？上尉？上尉怎么消失了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上尉掉进河里了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这、这家伙一击就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "啊，忘了他们听不懂......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "说，她在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她？你指谁？别问我，我什么不知道啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给、给我记住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！你们别急着撤退！先把上尉捞起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "那、那个人是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你认识她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "她可能是我的同事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不过，接到这项委托的应该是我啊？我可是好不容易才从陨星姐手里抢到这项任务的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "唔唔唔......也许她是为别的任务来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，赏金猎人好像溃退了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "事不宜迟，我们趁现在溜出村子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "既然还有其他干员在这个村子里，说不定事情会好办一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可萝尔，楼梯很黑，你要扶紧我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个，你要和她联络一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "嗯，如果可能的话，我想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#1",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "噗啊————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "哇——————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我的鼻子！这个门怎么自己弹开——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "欸？这里怎么会蹲着人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格拉尼！发生了什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们全都给我闭嘴！嘘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "......嘘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，你们这些干农活的肯定什么都不懂。没看到那个灾星吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论是哪个赏金猎人，都不会想和她碰面的！敢在她面前昂首挺胸的，多半是没见过她毁掉整座城市的样子吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "这么夸张吗！那不是靠她一个人就可以把————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "声音轻点，别被她发现！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "唔，可是我还要找她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说了小声点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "好，好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "感觉比罗德岛里流传的版本更离谱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那、那个怪物走了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，好像走了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总算走了，啊哟，吓死我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "是，是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原以为这点活我们一队就能搞定，怎么会碰上这种麻烦事。那种家伙都来了的话，得做好准备才能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈！拿枪的小子！居然在这里碰见你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有村长！你真是送上门来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格拉尼，你难道是故意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不，只是他们态度那么好，我也没回过神来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "废话少说，把村长交给我们！不然我手里这把刀保证就让你吃足苦头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#2",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "就用那把断刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这，这小子什么时候出的枪？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "用暗号召集附近还在的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的赏金猎人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有，去把之前用来毁掉农田的虫子都赶出来，让她们尝尝厉害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
